NOTE ON DATASETS

This licence applies to the source code in this repository only. The datasets
used by this project are not redistributed here and remain subject to their
own licence terms:

  - 140k Real and Fake Faces: real images derive from NVIDIA's Flickr-Faces-HQ
    (FFHQ) dataset, licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Non-commercial use only.

  - Deepfake and Real Images: derived from the OpenForensics dataset
    (https://zenodo.org/record/5528418), released for research purposes.

Users must download these datasets themselves under their own Kaggle account
and comply with the respective terms.
